// A CONSTRUCTOR IS A FUNCTION VALUE, or it refuses — never both compiling
// clean and trapping. Born RED 2026-09-08 while ratcheting the eta-wrapper
// census to zero: six of the wheel's twenty-eight eta-wrappers exist ONLY
// because `map((v) => TVar(v), vs)` cannot be written `map(TVar, vs)`, and
// the reason it cannot is not a type error — it is that the bare form
// compiles with ZERO diagnostics, emits, and faults at the first read of
// what it built.
//
// The control below (the lambda form) runs and answers 6, so the fixture
// isolates the constructor-as-value path alone. Expected when fixed: 6.
// (Hβ.emit.nonfn-binding-as-function-value — the effect-op face is the
// same peer one scheme over: `each(note, xs)` emits `(global.get $note)`
// for a global that never existed, and the assembler objects first.)
type Box = Box(Int) | Empty

fn unbox(b) = match b {
  Box(n) => n,
  Empty => 0,
}

fn main() = map(Box, [1, 2, 3]) |> map(unbox) |> fold(0, (a, b) => a + b)
